{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_2004_029umi", "source_sha256": "c0be8096a48de9cb3de47ab80c185551a1f205d8b389893dd5c8eb4dddeacb82", "ja": "さっきの本番でやった、激痛の足裏ツボ、試させて！\nみんな、「痛い！」ってモンゼツしてたけど……。", "zh": "让我按按看刚刚正式摄影时按的超痛脚底穴道！\n大家都痛到鬼吼鬼叫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_2005_029umi", "source_sha256": "d296037d755a8338d19bfc25179641b8c37915597fe525ae720eb8b05c6ed713", "ja": "だって私、ホントに、全然痛くなかったんだもん！\nなんか納得いかない！　だから、ねっ！　お願い！", "zh": "但我真的一点都不觉得痛嘛！\n总觉得很不服气！所以说嘛！拜托！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
